    "question": "The van der Waals equation for a real gas is given by (P + a/V²)(V - b) = RT, where P is pressure, V is volume, T is temperature, and R is the gas constant. What are the dimensions of the product 'ab'?",
    "option_a": "ML⁵T⁻²",
